# A self-intersecting sketch: a bowtie of four lines, which the closed
# contour check reports, so it has no area and nothing to extrude.
key s
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 400 400
down L 400 400
up L 400 400
move 400 200
down L 400 200
up L 400 200
move 200 400
down L 200 400
up L 200 400
move 200 200
hover
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
dump
polyerror
tw
answer ok
key a ctrl shift
key x shift
dump
polyerror
tw
save
